# seventh, Harbinger of the Seas (3), is not looked at, so it is refused as well. Up to two creature cards with mana value 3 or
# less enter together (each card's own value, not their total: Hired Blade and Giant Cindermaw add up to 6); the other four go to the bottom in the order the player says,
# as listed from the top of that group down, and Harbinger of the Seas stays on top.
